.TH WS63FLASH 1 "April 2026" "0.3.2"
.SH NAME
ws63fwpkg \- firmware manipulation tool for Hisilicon WS63

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ws63flash
[\fIOPTION...\fR] --build \fILOADERBOOT\fR [\fIBIN@ADDR...\fR]

.B ws63fwpkg
[\fIOPTION...\fR] --inject \fIFWPKG\fR [\fIBIN@ADDR\fR]

.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-o, --out
specify the output file (defaults to a.signed)

.SH ACTIONS
.TP
.B \-b, --build
build fwpkg from binaries

.B \-i, --inject
inject a binary to the fwpkg file

.SH OPTIONS
.B \-o, --out
specify the output file (defaults to stdout)

.TP
.B \-?, --help
give this help list

.TP
.B \--version
print program version

